# Invariants

These are the facts about `<project>` that must remain true. Each is
grounded in the current code and verifiable without running the binary.
Cite by ID in PR review (e.g. "violates INV-4").

For aspirational identity, see [`core-belief.md`](core-belief.md).
For explicit refusals, see [`anti-patterns.md`](anti-patterns.md).

